<p>Eagle&#x02019;s syndrome&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r145">[145]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r146">[146]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r147">[147]</xref></p>
