<p>Y</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Neck pain, odynophagia, headache</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Syringobulbia&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r148">[148]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r149">[149]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U, B</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>I</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Headache, dysarthria, dysphagia, ataxia, vertigo, nystagmus, tinnitus, facial pain/numbness, tongue wasting</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>Congenital/Genetic</bold></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Amyotrophic lateral sclerosis&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r150">[150]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U, B, S</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>I</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Progression to bilateral facial paralysis, tongue weakness and fasciculations, dysphagia, aphonia, limb weakness</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Bulbar and spinal muscle atrophy (Kennedy disease)&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r151">[151]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>B</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R, I</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Tongue atrophy and fasciculations, ataxia, quadriparesis, and sensory disturbances</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Chiari malformation&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r152">[152]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r148">[148]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U, B</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Cranial neuropathies, ataxia, nausea, and headaches</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Facial onset sensory and motor neuronopathy&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r153">[153]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r154">[154]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>B</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R, I</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Facial numbness, paresthesia, dysphagia, dysarthria, limb weakness and fasciculations, hyperreflexia, dementia</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Familial recurrent facial nerve palsy&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r155">[155]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Y</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 52px;">
                <td style="height: 52px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Hereditary motor and sensory neuropathy (Charcot-Marie-Tooth disease)&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r156">[156]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r157">[157]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r158">[158]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r159">[159]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r160">[160]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 52px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U (rare), B, S</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 52px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>I</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 52px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 52px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Limb weakness and distal muscle wasting, digital contractures, vision loss, numbness, pain, paresthesias, tremor, cranial neuropathies, ataxia, pyramidal signs, hemifacial spasm</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>M&#x000f6;bius syndrome&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r161">[161]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r162">[162]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r163">[163]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U, B, S</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Cranial neuropathies, cognitive delay</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Muscular dystrophy&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r164">[164]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r165">[165]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U, B, S</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>I</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Limb, shoulder, and trunk weakness with muscle wasting, foot drop, back pain, fatigue</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Nonsyndromic congenital (CULLP, thalidomide)&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r166">[166]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r167">[167]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r168">[168]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U, S</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Osteogenesis imperfecta&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r169">[169]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>B</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R, I</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Hearing loss, cranial neuropathies, gait instability, neck pain/headache, numbness, weakness, paresthesias, pyramidal symptoms</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Osteopetrosis&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r170">[170]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U, B</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R, I</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Hearing loss, vision loss, and headaches</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 52px;">
                <td style="height: 52px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Syndromic congenital (BOR, Goldenhar, CHARGE, VACTERL, Treacher-Collins)&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r171">[171]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r172">[172]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r173">[173]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r174">[174]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 52px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 52px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 52px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 52px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Hearing loss and ocular anomalies, depending on the syndrome</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>Infectious</bold></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><italic toggle="yes">Bartonella</italic> (cat scratch disease)&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r175">[175]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r176">[176]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">&#x000a0;</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Encephalopathy, cranial neuropathies, seizures, ataxia, hemiparesis, aphasia</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Bell&#x02019;s palsy&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r4">[4]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r111">[111]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r177">[177]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r111">[111]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U, B (rare)</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Rare</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>&#x000a0;Otalgia, hyperacusis, dysgeusia</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Chickenpox (VZV infection)&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r178">[178]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r179">[179]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U, B</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><italic toggle="yes">Coronavirus&#x000a0;</italic><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r180">[180]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r181">[181]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r182">[182]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Cranial neuropathies, fatigue, headache</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><italic toggle="yes">Cryptococcus&#x000a0;</italic><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r183">[183]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r184">[184]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r185">[185]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U, B</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Cranial neuropathies, hemiparesis, and altered mental status</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><italic toggle="yes">Cysticercosis</italic> (<italic toggle="yes">Taenia solium</italic> infection)&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r186">[186]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r187">[187]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Hemifacial spasm, seizure, stroke, limb weakness, pain, vertigo, ataxia, fever, hydrocephalus, cranial neuropathies</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><italic toggle="yes">Cytomegalovirus&#x000a0;</italic><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r188">[188]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r189">[189]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r190">[190]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r189">[189]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U, B</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Retinitis, cranial neuropathies, encephalitis, meningitis, myelitis, Guillain-Barr&#x000e9; syndrome</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Diphtheria&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r191">[191]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Cranial neuropathies, extremity palsy</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><italic toggle="yes">Enterovirus&#x000a0;</italic><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r192">[192]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r193">[193]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Flaccid paralysis, ataxia, Guillain-Barr&#x000e9;</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Epstein-Barr virus (mononucleosis)&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r194">[194]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r195">[195]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U, B</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Polyneuropathy</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Hepatitis virus (A, B, E)&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r196">[196]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r197">[197]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r198">[198]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r199">[199]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r200">[200]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U, B</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Cranial neuropathies, meningitis, encephalitis, polyradiculopathy, ataxia, Guillain-Barr&#x000e9; syndrome</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Human herpesvirus 6, 7 (<italic toggle="yes">Roseolovirus</italic>)&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r201">[201]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r202">[202]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Human immunodeficiency virus&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r203">[203]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r204">[204]</xref></p>
