              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Leprosy&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r210">[210]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r211">[211]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r212">[212]</xref></p>
