              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Leptospirosis&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r213">[213]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r214">[214]</xref></p>
