              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Necrotizing otitis externa (malignant otitis externa)&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r225">[225]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r226">[226]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r227">[227]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r225">[225]</xref></p>
