<p>Parotitis/parotid abscess&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r231">[231]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r232">[232]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r233">[233]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r234">[234]</xref></p>
