              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>West Nile virus&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r258">[258]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r28">[28]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r259">[259]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U, B</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Tremor, cognitive impairment, fever, diplopia, limb weakness, respiratory failure, hyporeflexia, dysphagia, dysarthria, hoarseness</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>Inflammatory</bold></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Beh&#x000e7;et&#x02019;s disease<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r260">[260]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r261">[261]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r262">[262]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U, B</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Y</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Cranial neuropathies, peripheral motor &#x0003e; sensory neuropathies, meningoencephalitis, intracranial hypertension, nystagmus, ataxia, headache, fever, tremor, mental status changes</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Encephalitis&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r228">[228]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U, B</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Cranial neuropathies, fever, headache, confusion, lethargy, seizures</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Eosinophilic granulomatosis with polyangiitis (Churg-Strauss syndrome)&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r263">[263]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r264">[264]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r265">[265]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U, B</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Hearing loss, sinusitis, optic neuropathy, headache, seizures, ataxia, confusion, limb weakness, cranial neuropathies</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Giant cell (temporal) arteritis (Horton's disease)&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r266">[266]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r267">[267]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>&#x000a0;Fever, temporal tenderness, vision loss</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Guillain-Barr&#x000e9; syndrome&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r67">[67]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r268">[268]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U, B</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Rare</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Stocking-glove neuropathy, ascending paralysis, cranial neuropathies, dysautonomia, ataxia, areflexia</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>IgG4-related disease&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r269">[269]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>I</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Y</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Hearing loss, cranial nerve palsies, and visual impairment</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Inclusion body myositis&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r270">[270]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r271">[271]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r272">[272]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r273">[273]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>B</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>I</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Shoulder and hip weakness, hand weakness, dysphagia</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Kawasaki disease&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r274">[274]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r275">[275]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U, B</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Irritability, lethargy, meningitis, encephalopathy, seizures, ataxia, cerebral infarction</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Melkersson-Rosenthal syndrome&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r276">[276]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>B</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Y</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Tongue fissuring, angioedema, gingival hypertrophy, headache, and trigeminal neuralgia</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Meningitis&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r277">[277]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U, B</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Cranial neuropathies, hemiparesis, altered mental status, stiff neck</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Microscopic polyangiitis&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r278">[278]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r279">[279]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r280">[280]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r281">[281]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U, B</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Hearing loss, tinnitus, vertigo, and cranial neuropathies</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Migraine&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r282">[282]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Headache, nausea, limb weakness</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Multiple sclerosis&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r283">[283]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U, B, S</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Cranial neuropathies, autonomic, sensory, and motor deficits, aphasia, fatigue, dysequilibrium, pain, depression</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Myasthenia gravis&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r284">[284]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U, B</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Y</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Ptosis, dysphagia, dysarthria, difficulty chewing, limb weakness, photophobia, ophthalmoplegia</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Polyarteritis/periarteritis nodosa&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r285">[285]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r286">[286]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r287">[287]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U, B</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Y</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Cranial neuropathies, headaches, confusion, lethargy, limb weakness</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Polyarteritis with granulomatosis (Wegener's granulomatosis)&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r288">[288]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r289">[289]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r290">[290]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r291">[291]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r292">[292]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U, B</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Hearing loss, otitis media, mastoiditis</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Pseudobulbar palsy&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r293">[293]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>B</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>I</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Dysarthria, dysphagia, tongue weakness, emotional lability</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Rheumatoid arthritis&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r294">[294]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r295">[295]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r294">[294]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U, B</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Y</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Tinnitus, vertigo, otalgia, hemifacial spasm</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Sarcoidosis&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r296">[296]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r297">[297]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U, B</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Y</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Cranial neuropathies, meningitis, ataxia, hypopituitarism, headache, seizures</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Scleroderma/systemic sclerosis&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r298">[298]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r299">[299]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r300">[300]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U, B, S</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R, I</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Cranial neuropathies, seizures, peripheral neuropathies, ataxia, migraine, aphasia, vision changes</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Sj&#x000f6;gren&#x02019;s syndrome&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r26">[26]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r301">[301]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r302">[302]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r295">[295]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U, B</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Y</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Peripheral neuropathy, cranial neuropathy - mostly trigeminal, tinnitus, vertigo, otalgia, hemifacial spasm</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Stevens-Johnson syndrome&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r303">[303]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>B</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Systemic lupus erythematosus&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r304">[304]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r305">[305]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U, B</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Y</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Papilledema, cranial neuropathies</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Thrombotic thrombocytopenic purpura&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r306">[306]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r307">[307]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>U, S</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Hemiplegia, aphasia, cognitive impairment, headache, ataxia, seizures</p>
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p><bold>Ischemic</bold></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 53px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 953px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 37px;">
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 481px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Stroke, cortical&#x000a0;<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r308">[308]</xref><xref ref-type="bibr" rid="article-21555.r309">[309]</xref></p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 62.05px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>S</p>
</td>
                <td style="height: 37px; width: 31.95px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>R</p>
</td>
